{
  "apiVersion": 1,
  "key": "bedrock",
  "name": {
    "en": "AWS Bedrock",
    "zh": "AWS Bedrock"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "Claude on Amazon Bedrock, through InvokeModel, for the built-in anthropic platform; requests in an OpenAI protocol are converted by the core. Accounts authorize with a Bedrock API key, a long-term access key or temporary credentials; the plugin signs requests of the latter two (SigV4). The plugin builds the final request and the core sends it: the plugin itself makes no network connection. Model prices are set by administrators in the core.",
    "zh": "Amazon Bedrock 上的 Claude：为内置 anthropic 平台通过 InvokeModel 提供，OpenAI 协议的请求由核心转换后走同一条路。账号可用 Bedrock API Key、长期 Access Key 或临时凭证鉴权，后两种的请求由插件签名（SigV4）。插件构造最终请求、由核心发送，插件自身不发起任何网络连接。模型价格由管理员在核心中配置。"
  },
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "publisher": "sub2api",
  "icon": "assets/bedrock-color.svg",
  "runtime": "grpc",
  "entry": {
    "grpc": {
      "binaries": "runtimes/{os}-{arch}/plugin"
    }
  },
  "hostCompat": ">=0.1.304 <0.2.0",
  "hostUICompat": "^4.0",
  "capabilities": [
    {
      "id": "platform.adapter.v1"
    }
  ],
  "accountTypes": [
