      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ui.native",
      "reason": {
        "en": "The account form of the three auth methods (BedrockAccountForm): API key, access key, temporary credentials, region and cross-region inference prefix",
        "zh": "三种鉴权方式的账号表单（BedrockAccountForm）：API Key、Access Key、临时凭证，以及区域与跨区域推理前缀"
